	(text "Pinouts follow the Pixhawk connector standard where one exists.\nThe ecosystem's GPS units, telemetry radios and power modules are\nbuilt to it; a novel pinout here means a custom loom for every\nperipheral.\n\nJST-GH 1.25 mm throughout - the same family Pixhawk uses, chosen\nfor its positive latch rather than its size."
		(at 31.75 13.97 0)
